 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Service Directory API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Namespaces, services and endpoints are registry metadata: no DNS zone, load balancer or health check is created, and services.resolve is not implemented. Endpoint addresses must be literal IPv4 or IPv6 addresses and ports must be within 0-65535; the network reference is recorded as given and not resolved. Deleting a namespace or service deletes its services and endpoints, as the official API does.",
  "title": "Service Directory (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
